OL,3,GNEWSA'Industrial-size' fly-tip dumped
OL,4,Aat beauty spot
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Industrial-sized" piles of waste have
OL,7,Fbeen dumped illegally at a popular
OL,8,Fbeauty spot.
OL,10,FSix mounds of rubbish have been
OL,11,Ffly-tipped at Button Oak, near Bewdley
OL,12,Fincluding concrete, rubble, pipes,
OL,13,Fbricks and clothes.
OL,15,FWest Mercia Police said officers were
OL,16,Finvestigating, while Forestry England
OL,17,Fsaid the culprits appeared to have cut
OL,18,Fthrough a metal lock and turned a CCTV
OL,19,Fcamera the wrong way before dumping the
OL,20,Fwaste.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
