OL,3,GNEWSA'Industrial-size' fly-tip dumped
OL,4,Aat beauty spot
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Boles, from Forestry England,
OL,7,Fsaid it was the worst fly tip he had
OL,8,F"ever seen", adding: "It's horrendous -
OL,9,Fwe've got to clean this up thoroughly
OL,10,Fnow, and it will come at a great cost
OL,11,Fto us."
